    - target: {fileID: 4223408136155989217, guid: c0a0edafc9d430b43b3b6107976bbe1c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4223408136155989217, guid: c0a0edafc9d430b43b3b6107976bbe1c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -0.8829956
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4459353801605931126, guid: c0a0edafc9d430b43b3b6107976bbe1c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'I''ve heard this sound before...



        The second machine came
        to life, and blue light filled its pipes. For the first time in a long while,
        I felt my memories returning.



        I saw a room bathed in sunlight.
        Two cups stood on a table. Someone was laughing beside me, then gently took
        my hand.



        I couldn''t see their face.



        But their voice...
        I knew that voice.



        "You promised we would never drain the flower
        completely."



        The machine groaned. The vision vanished, leaving
        behind nothing but pain and the smell of burnt herbs.



        I looked
        at the flower. Its petals had grown paler.



        So I had been here
        before. I had already tried to recover my memories.



        And perhaps
        I was the one who had made the world forget its magic.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
